  "notes": [
    "State 4 is the raise counter at four with the refractory timer at zero: the three low state bits are the counter, the three high bits the timer.",
    "c3s.reach.reachable_states puts 12 of the 64 states within reach of reset: 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56. An episode that halts at its first takeoff can only ever enter the first five. The other seven are the refractory timer counting down, and they appear only as the next state of the takeoff tick, which is where every episode stops.",
    "So state 4 is the rarest state a replayable episode enters at all, and this record enters it as often as any episode on the grid does."
  ]
